WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.356 --> 00:00:20.140 line:0
Public QuoteProof app loaded with the historical transaction; no wallet action or new write is used.

2
00:00:21.265 --> 00:00:28.462 line:0
Wallet-free preview shows the configured reference quote and guarded write boundary.

3
00:00:28.463 --> 00:00:40.914 line:0
Historical receipt comparison is read-only and shows the stored and historical matches.

4
00:00:42.363 --> 00:00:55.623 line:0
The actual Export receipt JSON action is exercised on the public page and compared with the known fixture.

5
00:00:58.493 --> 00:01:06.925 line:0
Recorded standalone verification evidence, executed from actual CLI results; not QuoteProof UI.

6
00:01:07.364 --> 00:01:14.835 line:0
Genuine receipt: standalone verification records valid, historical match, and stored match.

7
00:01:14.835 --> 00:01:21.879 line:0
A one-tinybar tamper fails local consistency before provider comparisons run.

8
00:01:21.879 --> 00:01:35.991 line:0
A recomputed amount can pass local arithmetic and historical round checks while differing from the stored commitment.

9
00:01:36.112 --> 00:01:46.162 line:0
A recomputed false price fails both the historical oracle and stored commitment comparisons.

10
00:01:46.281 --> 00:01:54.338 line:0
Recorded CLI evidence is historical and read-only; it is not payment, current-price, identity, or live-wallet truth.
